    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the batch_translate.py file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for translation. I will use the Google Cloud Translation API, which is a well-known service for translating text. I will import the necessary client library and use the API to translate a list of strings while preserving their order. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789850762754,
          "start": 1789850761306
